      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport and fly to Mérida. Take a walk through the colonial city, visiting San Ildefonso Cathedral, City Hall, the Governor’s Palace, Independence Square and Paseo de Montejo with its white mansions. Rest at your hotel in Mérida. The exact time of the walk and English-language service are arranged for this tour."
